{"@context":"http://iiif.io/api/presentation/3/context.json","id":"https://Bridie219.github.io/Storytelling/manifests/liminal-fantasy-a-case-study-on-the-chilling-adventures-of-sabrina.json","type":"Manifest","label":{"en":["Liminal Fantasy: A Case Study on The Chilling Adventures of Sabrina"]},"homepage":[{"id":"https://Bridie219.github.io/Storytelling","type":"Text","label":{"en":["Liminal Fantasy: A Case Study on The Chilling Adventures of Sabrina"]},"format":"text/html"}],"metadata":[{"label":{"en":["Description"]},"value":{"en":["Annotations by Bridie Pickering"]}},{"label":{"en":["Language"]},"value":{"en":["English"]}}],"items":[{"id":"https://Bridie219.github.io/Storytelling/liminal_fantasy_a_case_study_on_the_chilling_adventures_of_sabrina/canvas/5","type":"Canvas","duration":161,"annotations":[{"@context":"http://iiif.io/api/presentation/3/context.json","id":"https://Bridie219.github.io/Storytelling/manifests/liminal_fantasy_a_case_study_on_the_chilling_adventures_of_sabrina-canvas5-1","type":"AnnotationPage","label":{"en":["Default"]},"items":[{"@context":"http://www.w3.org/ns/anno.jsonld","type":"Annotation","motivation":["commenting","tagging"],"id":"https://Bridie219.github.io/Storytelling/liminal_fantasy_a_case_study_on_the_chilling_adventures_of_sabrina/canvas/5/page1","body":[{"type":"TextualBody","value":"Sabrina seems like a perfectly normal teenaged girl, going home after a date. It seems very much like she has a normal life, until the door is closed to the \"real\" world, acting as a barrier between the world outside, and the magical world Sabrina exists in at home.\nThat is what makes The Chilling Adventures of Sabrina a liminal fantasy text, because she exists on the cusp of magic, pretending to live a normal life, but also existing in a world full of magic.","format":"text/plain","motivation":"commenting"},{"type":"TextualBody","value":"Fantasy","format":"text/plain","purpose":"tagging","motivation":"tagging"},{"type":"TextualBody","value":"Television Show","format":"text/plain","purpose":"tagging","motivation":"tagging"},{"type":"TextualBody","value":"Liminal Fantasy","format":"text/plain","purpose":"tagging","motivation":"tagging"},{"type":"TextualBody","value":"Worldbuilding","format":"text/plain","purpose":"tagging","motivation":"tagging"},{"type":"TextualBody","value":"Rules","format":"text/plain","purpose":"tagging","motivation":"tagging"}],"target":"https://Bridie219.github.io/Storytelling/liminal_fantasy_a_case_study_on_the_chilling_adventures_of_sabrina/canvas/5#t=0,20"},{"@context":"http://www.w3.org/ns/anno.jsonld","type":"Annotation","motivation":["commenting","tagging"],"id":"https://Bridie219.github.io/Storytelling/liminal_fantasy_a_case_study_on_the_chilling_adventures_of_sabrina/canvas/5/page1","body":[{"type":"TextualBody","value":"As soon as she is home alone, the influence of the outside world fades away, and Sabrina begins using magic with a natural ease that makes it clear magic has been a part of her life for a very long time. \nThe choice between two worlds could be explained as intrusive fantasy, but in this case liminal fantasy is more fitting. Sabrina will either have to reject or accept the magic that exists as a part of her life.","format":"text/plain","motivation":"commenting"},{"type":"TextualBody","value":"Fantasy","format":"text/plain","purpose":"tagging","motivation":"tagging"},{"type":"TextualBody","value":"Television Show","format":"text/plain","purpose":"tagging","motivation":"tagging"},{"type":"TextualBody","value":"Worldbuilding","format":"text/plain","purpose":"tagging","motivation":"tagging"},{"type":"TextualBody","value":"Rules","format":"text/plain","purpose":"tagging","motivation":"tagging"},{"type":"TextualBody","value":"Liminal Fantasy","format":"text/plain","purpose":"tagging","motivation":"tagging"}],"target":"https://Bridie219.github.io/Storytelling/liminal_fantasy_a_case_study_on_the_chilling_adventures_of_sabrina/canvas/5#t=21,40"},{"@context":"http://www.w3.org/ns/anno.jsonld","type":"Annotation","motivation":["commenting","tagging"],"id":"https://Bridie219.github.io/Storytelling/liminal_fantasy_a_case_study_on_the_chilling_adventures_of_sabrina/canvas/5/page1","body":[{"type":"TextualBody","value":"The choice between her friends and family makes it clear that it's an internal struggle. Either Sabrina will accept her place in the magical world, or she will choose to reject it. The magic's continuing existence depends entirely on Sabrina choosing it. ","format":"text/plain","motivation":"commenting"},{"type":"TextualBody","value":"Fantasy","format":"text/plain","purpose":"tagging","motivation":"tagging"},{"type":"TextualBody","value":"Television Show","format":"text/plain","purpose":"tagging","motivation":"tagging"},{"type":"TextualBody","value":"Worldbuilding","format":"text/plain","purpose":"tagging","motivation":"tagging"},{"type":"TextualBody","value":"Rules","format":"text/plain","purpose":"tagging","motivation":"tagging"},{"type":"TextualBody","value":"Liminal Fantasy","format":"text/plain","purpose":"tagging","motivation":"tagging"}],"target":"https://Bridie219.github.io/Storytelling/liminal_fantasy_a_case_study_on_the_chilling_adventures_of_sabrina/canvas/5#t=41,49"},{"@context":"http://www.w3.org/ns/anno.jsonld","type":"Annotation","motivation":["commenting","tagging"],"id":"https://Bridie219.github.io/Storytelling/liminal_fantasy_a_case_study_on_the_chilling_adventures_of_sabrina/canvas/5/page1","body":[{"type":"TextualBody","value":"The ritual ceremony acts as an indicator of magic, but Sabrina's choice to leave before the ritual is complete makes it clear that she intends to reject the magic - or at least, reject what magic means to her family. Sabrina has to decide what she wants her magic to be like, in order to choose magic. ","format":"text/plain","motivation":"commenting"},{"type":"TextualBody","value":"Fantasy","format":"text/plain","purpose":"tagging","motivation":"tagging"},{"type":"TextualBody","value":"Television Show","format":"text/plain","purpose":"tagging","motivation":"tagging"},{"type":"TextualBody","value":"Rules","format":"text/plain","purpose":"tagging","motivation":"tagging"},{"type":"TextualBody","value":"Liminal Fantasy","format":"text/plain","purpose":"tagging","motivation":"tagging"}],"target":"https://Bridie219.github.io/Storytelling/liminal_fantasy_a_case_study_on_the_chilling_adventures_of_sabrina/canvas/5#t=50,70"},{"@context":"http://www.w3.org/ns/anno.jsonld","type":"Annotation","motivation":["commenting","tagging"],"id":"https://Bridie219.github.io/Storytelling/liminal_fantasy_a_case_study_on_the_chilling_adventures_of_sabrina/canvas/5/page1","body":[{"type":"TextualBody","value":"Sabrina is also half human, half witch, so she's being torn between the worlds. She feels a connection to both, and to choose just one means rejecting the other. She is isolated from both worlds, because of her connection to both. She belongs to neither world entirely, which makes her choice that much more difficult. She has to find a balance between the human part of herself, and the witch part.\n\n\n\n","format":"text/plain","motivation":"commenting"},{"type":"TextualBody","value":"Fantasy","format":"text/plain","purpose":"tagging","motivation":"tagging"},{"type":"TextualBody","value":"Television Show","format":"text/plain","purpose":"tagging","motivation":"tagging"},{"type":"TextualBody","value":"Worldbuilding","format":"text/plain","purpose":"tagging","motivation":"tagging"},{"type":"TextualBody","value":"Liminal Fantasy","format":"text/plain","purpose":"tagging","motivation":"tagging"},{"type":"TextualBody","value":"Rules","format":"text/plain","purpose":"tagging","motivation":"tagging"}],"target":"https://Bridie219.github.io/Storytelling/liminal_fantasy_a_case_study_on_the_chilling_adventures_of_sabrina/canvas/5#t=71,103"},{"@context":"http://www.w3.org/ns/anno.jsonld","type":"Annotation","motivation":["commenting","tagging"],"id":"https://Bridie219.github.io/Storytelling/liminal_fantasy_a_case_study_on_the_chilling_adventures_of_sabrina/canvas/5/page1","body":[{"type":"TextualBody","value":"The trailer makes it clear that whilst magic exists in Sabrina's world, her relationship with it is complicated. She uses it, but she also doesn't want to be consumed by it. She does not want to follow the dark path, instead, she wants to make her own choices. Her desire to resist the path she's being led down makes this text a liminal fantasy, because she straddles the border of the magical and nonmagical.\n\n\n\n","format":"text/plain","motivation":"commenting"},{"type":"TextualBody","value":"Fantasy","format":"text/plain","purpose":"tagging","motivation":"tagging"},{"type":"TextualBody","value":"Television Show","format":"text/plain","purpose":"tagging","motivation":"tagging"},{"type":"TextualBody","value":"Worldbuilding","format":"text/plain","purpose":"tagging","motivation":"tagging"},{"type":"TextualBody","value":"Rules","format":"text/plain","purpose":"tagging","motivation":"tagging"},{"type":"TextualBody","value":"Magic System","format":"text/plain","purpose":"tagging","motivation":"tagging"},{"type":"TextualBody","value":"Liminal Fantasy","format":"text/plain","purpose":"tagging","motivation":"tagging"}],"target":"https://Bridie219.github.io/Storytelling/liminal_fantasy_a_case_study_on_the_chilling_adventures_of_sabrina/canvas/5#t=104,148"}]}],"items":[{"id":"https://Bridie219.github.io/Storytelling/liminal_fantasy_a_case_study_on_the_chilling_adventures_of_sabrina-canvas5/paintings","type":"AnnotationPage","items":[{"id":"https://Bridie219.github.io/Storytelling/liminal_fantasy_a_case_study_on_the_chilling_adventures_of_sabrina-canvas5/paintings","type":"Annotation","motivation":"painting","body":{"id":"https://youtu.be/R2gbPxeNk2E?si=NwT5TOvdulBdyo64","type":"Video","format":"unknown","duration":161},"target":"https://Bridie219.github.io/Storytelling/liminal_fantasy_a_case_study_on_the_chilling_adventures_of_sabrina/canvas/5"}]}]}]}